    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 19, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "所有人已聚集在会客厅，<br>\n随后典狱长现身在众人面前。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0202Adv16_Narrative001"]}},
    {"op": "ModifyCharacterExtended", "line": 21, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0, "ScenePosition": [50.0], "IdAndAppearance": "Warden.1"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 23, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "很好，大家都到齐了吧。<br>\n方才已经通知过各位，<br>\n又发生了一起凶杀案。", "AuthorId": "Warden", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0202Adv16_Warden001"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 25, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "和上次一样，我们会举行先行投票。<br>\n要是让可疑人士销毁证据可就麻烦了。", "AuthorId": "Warden", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0202Adv16_Warden002"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 27, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "其实并不需要先行投票……不，甚至连审判都不需要。", "AuthorId": "Hiro", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0202Adv16_Hiro001"]}},
    {"op": "HideAllCharacters", "line": 29, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0}},
    {"op": "ModifyCharacterExtended", "line": 30, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0, "ScenePosition": [50.0], "IdAndAppearance": "Leia.Surprised1"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 32, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "希罗，你这是什么意思？", "AuthorId": "Leia", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0202Adv16_Leia001"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 34, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "凶手是谁很明显。<br>\n只能是拿着枪站在现场的艾玛！", "AuthorId": "Hiro", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0202Adv16_Hiro002"]}},
    {"op": "HideAllCharacters", "line": 36, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0}},
    {"op": "ModifyCharacterExtended", "line": 37, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0, "ScenePosition": [30.0], "IdAndAppearance": "Ema.Angry1,ArmR3"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 39, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "……可疑的是你啊，希罗。", "AuthorId": "Ema", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0202Adv16_Ema001"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 41, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "一直沉默不语的艾玛，低声喃喃道。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0202Adv16_Narrative002"]}},
    {"op": "ModifyCharacterExtended", "line": 43, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0, "ScenePosition": [70.0], "IdAndAppearance": "Hiro.Angry1"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 45, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "你想说什么？", "AuthorId": "Hiro", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0202Adv16_Hiro003"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 47, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "是你约我在那个时间点见面。", "AuthorId": "Ema", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0202Adv16_Ema002"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 49, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "你从一开始就想陷害我吧。<br>", "AuthorId": "Ema", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0202Adv16_Ema003"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 51, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "顿时少女们的视线都集中在我身上。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0202Adv16_Narrative003"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 53, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "根据我和艾玛刚才的对话，<br>\n我已经预料到她会这么说了。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0202Adv16_Narrative004"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 55, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "我毅然决然地接住了她的话。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0202Adv16_Narrative005"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 57, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "所以呢？你的意思是<br>\n我杀害了可可，再嫁祸给你？", "AuthorId": "Hiro", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0202Adv16_Hiro004"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 59, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "…………", "AuthorId": "Ema", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0202Adv16_Ema004"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 61, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "我们怒视彼此，视线交错。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0202Adv16_Narrative006"]}},
    {"op": "HideAllCharacters", "line": 63, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0}},
    {"op": "ModifyCharacterExtended", "line": 64, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0, "ScenePosition": [50.0], "IdAndAppearance": "Warden.1"}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 66, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "啊——，可以请你们到审判时再争辩吗？<br>\n总之，现在请赶快开始投票。", "AuthorId": "Warden", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0202Adv16_Warden003"]}},
    {"op": "HideAllCharacters", "line": 68, "indent": 0, "params": {"Lazy": 0}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 70, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "在典狱长的催促下，<br>\n少女们纷纷开始在手机上投票。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0202Adv16_Narrative007"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 72, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "说实话，<br>\n我完全不清楚发生了什么事。", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0202Adv16_Narrative008"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 74, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "但是我和艾玛的争吵<br>\n势必会导致一种投票结果——", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0202Adv16_Narrative009"]}},
    {"op": "ModifyBackgroundExtended", "line": 76, "indent": 0, "params": {"TintColor": "#000000", "Lazy": 0, "AppearanceAndTransition": "5_1"}},
    {"op": "PlaySfxModified", "line": 79, "indent": 0, "params": {"SfxPath": "Sfx_3", "Volume": 1.0, "Loop": 0, "FadeInDuration": 0.0}},
